---
---

<section class="section pb-pricing fade-in" aria-labelledby="pb-pricing-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="section-label pb-network-label">Pricing</span>
      <h2 class="headline-lg" id="pb-pricing-title">
        Built for networks.<br />
        <span class="pb-headline-accent">You only pay for active members.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg">
        We do not charge per feature. Pricing scales with how active your network is —
        so your cost stays aligned with the value you are delivering.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pb-pricing-cards">
      <div class="pb-pricing-card">
        <div class="pb-pricing-card-header">
          <h3>Network Platform Fee</h3>
          <span class="pb-pricing-card-freq">Monthly</span>
        </div>
        <p>Covers your partner dashboard, brand configuration, sector settings, and partner support line. Scales with your network tier (up to 50 / up to 250 / 250+ members).</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Full partner dashboard access</li>
          <li>Brand and sector configuration</li>
          <li>Member invitation management</li>
          <li>Network analytics and reporting</li>
          <li>Dedicated partner support</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="pb-pricing-card pb-pricing-card--active">
        <div class="pb-pricing-card-header">
          <h3>Per Active Member</h3>
          <span class="pb-pricing-card-freq">Monthly, per live member</span>
        </div>
        <p>Only members who are actively using the platform count. A member who registered but has not transacted does not trigger the fee.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Full Pagayo commerce stack for each member</li>
          <li>First-line support handled by Pagayo</li>
          <li>All channels: webshop, POS, QR, subscriptions</li>
          <li>Stripe payments for every member</li>
          <li>Pass on or absorb — the structure is yours to decide</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="pb-pricing-card-note">
          Active = at least one transaction in the billing period.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pb-pricing-footer">
      <p>
        We build the pricing specifics with you based on network size, sector, and how you want to structure the commercial relationship with your members.
        No fixed pricing page. Every Powered by Pagayo arrangement is tailored.
      </p>
      <a href="/powered-by-contact?intent=pricing" class="btn btn-pb btn-lg">Get a pricing proposal →</a>
      <span class="pb-pricing-footer-hint">We will send a concrete proposal with network tier options, activation scenarios, and ROI modelling.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pb-pricing-cards {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .pb-pricing-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  .pb-pricing-card--active {
    border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.3);
    background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.04);
  }

  .pb-pricing-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .pb-pricing-card-header h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .pb-pricing-card-freq {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .pb-pricing-card > p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .pb-pricing-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pb-pricing-card li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .pb-pricing-card li::before {
    content: '✓';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--pb-network);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .pb-pricing-card-note {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
  }

  .pb-pricing-footer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .pb-pricing-footer p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pb-pricing-footer-hint {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
    max-width: 400px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pb-pricing-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
